[h1]The Wall — CWYS[/h1]

A ready-to-play Random New World map built around a long north–south continent with a mountain spine, deeply indented shores and additional continents and islands to the west. Explore it from the Old World or start as one of its native countries.

[h2]🌎 This world[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]The Wall preset:[/b] Maximum Wall width set to 19% of the generation area, a strong mountain spine and high coastal irregularity. Natural gaps are allowed.
[*][b]Expanded oceans:[/b] The wider Pacific generation area is enabled, with the land amount set to 36.5%.
[*][b]More peoples and states:[/b] Population set to Many (1.8× the generator's baseline), with Many states. The finished world contains 399 native states and 505 tribes.
[*][b]Extraordinary societies set to Often:[/b] This world has four great empires, three sacred centres, a fractured realm and a maritime league.
[*][b]More precious resources:[/b] Precious-resource placement weight is set to 2× normal. Ordinary resource weights remain at their defaults.
[*][b]New geography:[/b] 7,101 land locations, 201 lakes and 1,269 sea zones, with generated terrain, climates, rivers and sea routes. The Old World remains unchanged.
[/list]

[h2]▶ How to play[/h2]
This download contains a complete, ready-to-play world. Subscribe, enable this map in your playset and start a new 1337 campaign. You do not need to run or enable the RNW generator to play it.

Use one RNW world at a time. Restart EU5 when switching maps, and keep this world mod for its saves.

Generated with RNW 1.1.0 for EU5 1.4.6. Across the Pillars is optional.

